  "title": "Mediterranean Chicken with Pepperoncini and Kalamatas",
  "description": "Bring the flavors of the Mediterranean to your kitchen with chicken cooked slowly on a bed of pepperoncini, olives and garlic with a creamy, lemon sauce. Serve over couscous or white or brown rice.",
  "authors": [
